                    </ref> “U.S. Economic Aid to China” (Ch. I).</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d167-f3" n="14" xml:id="d167-f3-content">
                <p>No. 933, <ref target="#pg209">p. 209</ref>.</p>
            </note>
